Inclusion is a Netflix value and we strive to host a meaningful interview experience for all candidates. If you want an accommodation/adjustment for a disability or any other reason during the hiring process, please send a request to your recruiting partner. For more information on how to prepare, please visit our candidate page.


We want to get to know you and understand your unique skills and how you think. We acknowledge you might use AI at some point during your job search, but to keep the process fair and genuinely surface what you have to say about a certain topic rather than what AI would say, we ask that you don’t use AI tools that can impact the outcomes of your interview. We value transparency and want you to know that your interviewer may use an AI-powered tool to take notes on the conversation. Regardless, you can choose to opt out of our use of AI for note-taking.